2Ki 11:1 , Jehoash, being saved by Jehosheba his aunt from Athaliah's massacre of the seed royal, is hid six years in the house of God;
2Ki 11:4 , Jehoiada, giving order to the captains, in the seventh year anoints him king;
2Ki 11:13 , Athaliah is slain;
2Ki 11:17 , Jehoiada restores the worship of God.
